lue":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T10:56:55-08:00","id":403494,"title":"","content":"I figure whenever you guys ask a Storyteller Character a question, or otherwise do something that would require an immediate reaction, I'll go ahead and post so that the next person in the turn order will know what the person said/did, so they don't have to wait around for another cycle before knowing how the person responded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T11:43:40-08:00","id":403518,"title":"","content":"Cool, I'll keep that in mind from now on. I'd figured Astoria would do most of the talking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T12:00:16-08:00","id":403570,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I realize the Astoria centered situation worked out weirdly with you having the highest initiative, but kuddos on making the best of it Thorbes<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions"