803-techpriest","user":"Techpriest","date":". 02-25-2015, 07:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T16:14:38-08:00","id":419510,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/391814-ooc-mage-the-awakening-anthology-of-power?p=419469#post419469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okey dokey! Though I thought we can actually keep the current Initiative and nothing breaks:<br /> <br /> The last post before yours, Techriest, was mine. Then it would go NoiseConspiracy, wich as Astoria is with Meristoktrix on the Nest could go and post now as that and the hospital scene happen at the same time, right? Then will be Phoenix turn, and he can just appear when that conversation between doc Bates and Ms. Collins is starting. Then would be my turn again, etc, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that could be done, but since two separate scenes are going at the same time, it'd be a little more organized if we kept the posts for each scene with each other, instead of mixing them. Makes it easier to reference back for us (I tend to do <i>a lot</i> of referencing for PBP because it's easier to write in context) and to just plain read for anyone looking in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attac