tps://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T19:25:06-08:00","id":422477,"title":"","content":"The +1 for the room is fine, so a total +4 equipment bonus. If you want bonuses for Bardo's threats, you could do a Teamwork Intimidation, with <b>Thorbes</b> rolling Manipulation + Intimidation, and any successes adding to Phoenix' dicepool.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, everyone gets 3 xp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T20:41:05-08:00","id":422566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Techpriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/391814-ooc-mage-the-awakening-anthology-of-power?p=422477#post422477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The +1 for the room is fine, so a total +4 equipment bonus. If you want bonuses for Bardo's threats, you could do a Teamwork Intimidation, with <b>Thorbes</b> rolling Manipulation + Intimidation, and any successes adding to Phoenix' dicepool.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, everyone gets 3 xp.</div> </div> </div> </div>If Bardo wants to do that, I'll simply add the successes to the roll later. As it is, Phoenix will try to get answers through some good ol' fightin' words and knuckle crackin'.<br /> <br /> [Getting Answers: Presence + Intimidation + 3 Serum + 1 Room + 2 Bardo = 11 dice \u2192 ((<b>10</b>, <b>8</b>),6,3,2,5,<b>9</b>,6,7,7,6,4) 3 successes]<br /> <br /> As for the experience, I added a little XP Log as well to keep track of everything I purchased.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":".  Added 2 extra dice to the roll 02-28-2015, 01:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T21:29:39-08:00","id":422592,"title":"","content":"First of all: yay experience! I'll just put that there in the bank for now and save it for a rainy day.<br /> <br /> Second, I'll add my roll as well here, seeing as it makes more sense than bogging things down needlessly. Astoria begins her first pass through the scroll, trying to get a general overview of what it is and what's written in it.<br /> <br /> <i>Decipher Scroll = Intelligence 2 + Investigation 2 = 7, <b>10</b>, 4, 5. Reroll = 3. <b>1 Success</b></i><br /> <br /> (wasn't 100% if my cryptography specialty would apply in this case, so left it out for now.)<br /> <br /> Also, activating The Supernal Eye to see anything magical that might stick out about it.<br /> <br /> <i>The Supernal Eye = Wits 3 + Occult 2 + Prime 2 = 1, 2, 7, <b>8</b>, <b>8</b>, <b>8</b>, <b>9</b>. <b>4 Successes</b></i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4859-noiseconspiracy","name":"NoiseConspiracy