ration...Cortex...but personal...&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Astoria: </b>The cryptography on the scroll extensive. You've barely scratched the surface, only just revealing a series of twisting patterns in the marks.There are some minor spells on the scroll, including wards against scrying, fire, and physical degradation. Meristoktrix comforts you about Fell.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Turns out the headache was a prelude to a stomach virus...ugh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4803,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","user":"Techpriest","date":". 03-02-2015, 07:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T12:57:16-08:00","id":429186,"title":"","content":"The virus continues...<br /> <br /> Just want you guys to know I'll get back to posting when I feel better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T13:42:01-08:00","id":429232,"title":"","content":"Don't worry, take care of yourself and get better, ok? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"atta