n Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T08:05:34-07:00","id":444283,"title":"","content":"Yikes, looks like it is.<br /> <br /> I'll get to this today. I have a decent load of work to do, but should have a response.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4859-noiseconspiracy","name":"NoiseConspiracy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4859_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T22:23:48-07:00","id":451304,"title":"","content":"It's taking me a bit to figure out what I want to do. Crapcarp and Thorbes can go before me while I sort out my action.<br /> <br /> What are the terms on trying another cryptology roll? I assume that if I can I'll have a penalty for essentially trying a successive attempt, but I feel like I am doing an injustice if I don't give it another shot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4859-noiseconspiracy","name":"NoiseConspiracy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4859_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T04:12:40-07:00","id":451415,"title":"","content":"Isn't it an Extended roll? I think you just keep rolling until you either reach the neccesary successes or hit your dice pool cap, wichever happens first. You got 1 Success on your first roll, you can keep working on it without problem. If you had scored no successes then maybe a -1 penalty for further attempts might have been in order, but you are fine <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> EDIT: you can go and make several rolls if you want to fast forward the scene to the resolution, wichever it ends up being. I remeber TP sugesting something like that for other Extended rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 03-21-2015, 07:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T16:52:51-07:00","id":452142,"title":"","content":"I think perhaps this got lost in the noise...it's a conspiracy. (badum tiss)<br /> <br /> From post #144<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Techpriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/391814-ooc-mage-the-awakening-anthology-of-power?p=418136#post418136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Astoria: </b>Decoding the scroll will be an extended action of Intelligence + Investigation with your Cryptography specialty. Go ahead and make five rolls, with each roll representing an hour of work. (Five rolls because that's your dice pool, as per the limits on extended actions).</div> </div> </div> </di